      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRICKLE (8) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 24.10 beating Marble Sunset. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. SUPER MAX (1) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from five tries. Below best last time at this track (24.60) in a Grade 5, finishing a 3.5 lengths fifth. Looks one of the chances. TWO TRUTHS (2) finds it hard to break through. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (24.32) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Expected to be in the finish again. COLLINDA RAMSAY (7) placed here at this trip last start - cannot be ignored.",
